sections := {
        "1": {
            "title": "Purpose",
            "excerpt": "a. This Departmental Regulation (DR) establishes the Civil Rights Impact Analysis (CRIA)\n      policy and procedures for the U.S. Department of Agriculture’s (USDA or the\n      Department) employment, federally conducted and federally assisted programs and\n\n\n                                             1\n       activities.\n\n  b. The regulation also provides guidance to the agencies, Departmental Management (DM),\n     National Appeals Division (NAD), Office of the Inspector General (OIG), and sta...",
        },
        "2": {
            "title": "Special Instructions/Cancellation",
            "excerpt": "a. This regulation replaces DR 4300-004, Civil Rights Impact Analysis, dated May 30, 2003.\n\n  b. Agencies must update their processes and procedures in accordance with this DR within\n     120 calendar days of the effective date.",
