        "13": {
            "title": "Conclusion",
            "excerpt": "The CRIAs will contain a Conclusion section that will include the following:\n\n  a. A summary statement indicating whether the proposed action, its objective, and/or\n     implementation will have an adverse or disproportionate impact on protected groups; and\n\n  b. A certification signed by the current Civil Rights Director or ASA (for DM and Staff\n     Offices only) (See Appendix B for example CRIA Certification).",
